              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "honestabe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought it was pretty tasty! I used 2 c. of dried beans that I had previously cooked, and added some water for consistency when I was blending. I also used 3 tsp. of basalmic, and 1 tsp of apple cider vinegar.",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-18T12:05:13.487Z"
