              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gayleskornerkitchen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this recipe this morning so the flavors could meld together by lunch time. I skipped the ketchup and used 1/2 diced roma tomato in it's place. I didn't rinse the beans and I only partially drained them. I'm guessing I used about 1 T of the juice in the recipe. I used Bush seasoned black beans and it turned out really~really yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2009-05-01T07:10:09.473Z"
          },
          {
