              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Adriana"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I followed the recipe and it turned out too sweet and weird tasting. I tried to fix it by adding more salt, 1 tsp minced garlic, 1/4 onion and 1/2 tbsp hot chili sauce, which helped by giving it a more \"mexican\" flavor. Did not try this, but I think adding fresh cilantro should make it even better. Sorry about all the changes, but the original is just not good.",
            "datePublished": "2008-12-15T13:09:52.567Z"
